---
/**
 * Homepage explanation of invite-only access.
 */
---

<section id="invite" class="w-full bg-surface">
  <div class="max-w-container-max mx-auto px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop pt-10 pb-20 md:pb-28">
    <div class="relative w-full bg-primary text-on-primary rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 md:p-16 overflow-hidden botanical-shadow">
      <div class="relative z-10 max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-8">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1 bg-secondary/20 rounded-full border border-secondary/40">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-secondary" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="font-label-sm text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-secondary font-bold">
            Invite-only access
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-4">
          <h2 class="font-display-md text-display-md text-on-primary">How invite access works</h2>
          <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-primary/80 leading-relaxed">
            Botanica is a private store. A valid member invite starts a short access review.
          </p>
        </div>

        <ol class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 border-y border-white/20 py-6">
          <li class="space-y-2">
            <span class="font-label-sm text-secondary text-label-sm uppercase tracking-widest font-bold">01</span>
            <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-on-primary">Receive a member invite</h3>
            <p class="font-body-sm text-on-primary/70">A current member shares an invite with you.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="space-y-2">
            <span class="font-label-sm text-secondary text-label-sm uppercase tracking-widest font-bold">02</span>
            <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-on-primary">Apply with the valid code</h3>
            <p class="font-body-sm text-on-primary/70">Enter the code you received at the invite page.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="space-y-2">
            <span class="font-label-sm text-secondary text-label-sm uppercase tracking-widest font-bold">03</span>
            <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-on-primary">Enter after approval</h3>
            <p class="font-body-sm text-on-primary/70">Approved members can enter the private store.</p>
          </li>
        </ol>

        <a
          href="/invite"
          class="inline-block px-8 py-3.5 border border-white/30 text-on-primary font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-widest rounded-full hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors"
        >
          Use an invite code
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
